Harmattan: Tracker 0.10's libtracker-sparql

The tracker backend asks pkg-config for tracker-sparql-0.14. The phone runs Tracker 0.10, whose
libtracker-sparql-0.10 (in the SDK sysroot) has every function and value type the backend uses:
tracker_sparql_connection_get/_query and the cursor's next, get_n_columns, get_value_type,
get_string, get_integer and get_double. The backend is built with tracker_enabled=yes
(scripts/build-qt.sh); without it the module builds the null gallery, which finds nothing.

--- a/src/gallery/tracker/tracker.pri
+++ b/src/gallery/tracker/tracker.pri
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@ INCLUDEPATH += $$PWD
 QT += dbus
 
 CONFIG += link_pkgconfig
-PKGCONFIG_PRIVATE += tracker-sparql-0.14
+PKGCONFIG_PRIVATE += tracker-sparql-0.10
 
 PRIVATE_HEADERS += \
         $$PWD/qgallerydbusinterface_p.h \
